_count":50971,"language":"Go","has_issues":true,"has_projects":false,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":10239,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":204,"license":{"key":"apache-2.0","name":"Apache License 2.0","spdx_id":"Apache-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["cncf","consensus","database","distributed-database","distributed-systems","etcd","go","key-value","kubernetes","raft"],"visibility":"public","forks":10239,"open_issues":204,"watchers":50971,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"We would like to ensure lease related operations are handled correctly in failure recovery path but currently there is no lease testing in the functional tester.\n\nInvariants to test:\n- Lease should not expire before the returned TTL\n- Any key attached to an expired/revoked lease should be removed\n- All members key + lease state should have same hash for the same revision\n\nImplementation would be a new stresser, `leaseStresser`:\n- creates N lease and attach M keys onto each lease it creates. Sends keeps alive to all created leases.\n- randomly the leaseStresser drops leases from the set of leases it keeps; creates new lease to replace it.\n- checks the dropped leases are expired, and the keys attached to them are deleted.\n- checks the invariants\n\nWork break down\n1. Setup etcd locally with 3 etcd clusters including agent\n2. Run functional tester on the local etcd clusters\n3. Modify the code for lease testing\n4. Testing the modification locally.\n5. Send PR for review\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/etcd-io/etcd/issues/6380/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"ht